<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>DEVANIX TECHNOLOGIES</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      background-color: #060913;
      color: #F8FAFC;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px 8%;
      background-color: #090D1C;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: #F8FAFC;
    }
    .logo span {
      color: #00F0FF;
    }
    nav a {
      color: #94A3B8;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 25px;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }
    nav a:hover {
      color: #00F0FF;
    }
    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 100px 20px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08) 0%, #060913 70%);
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      color: #00F0FF;
      text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .tagline {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto 35px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: #E2E8F0;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .hero-buttons a {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      margin: 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background-color: #00F0FF;
      color: #060913;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4);
    }
    .btn-secondary {
      border: 1px solid #00F0FF;
      color: #00F0FF;
    }
    .wings-section {
      padding: 70px 8%;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .wings-section h2, .institute-section h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #00F0FF;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .wings-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
    }
    .card {
      background-color: #0D1326;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25);
      transition: 0.3s;
    }
    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35);
      border-color: #00F0FF;
    }
    .card h3 {
      color: #00F0FF;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .card p {
      color: #94A3B8;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .institute-section {
      padding: 70px 8%;
      text-align: center;
      background-color: #090D1C;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
    }
    .institute-section p {
      max-width: 750px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: #CBD5E1;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      color: #64748B;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header { flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; }
      nav a { margin: 0 10px; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">DEVANIX <span>TECHNOLOGIES</span></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#wings">Wings</a>
      <a href="#institute">Institute</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>DEVANIX TECHNOLOGIES</h1>
    <p class="tagline">"Securing Digital Frontiers, Empowering Future Tech."</p>
    <div class="hero-buttons">
      <a href="#wings" class="btn-primary">Explore Our Wings</a>
      <a href="#institute" class="btn-secondary">Devanix Institute</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="wings" class="wings-section">
    <h2>Our Four Core Wings</h2>
    <div class="wings-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>DEVANIX CYBER</h3>
        <p>Protecting digital assets, securing data, and building resilient cyber defense systems.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>DEVANIX AI</h3>
        <p>Developing intelligent automation and next-generation artificial intelligence solutions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>DEVANIX SOFTWARE</h3>
        <p>Engineering scalable, modern web and enterprise software applications.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>DEVANIX CLOUD</h3>
        <p>Delivering reliable, high-speed, and secure cloud infrastructure and hosting.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="institute" class="institute-section">
    <h2>DEVANIX INSTITUTE</h2>
    <p class="tagline">"Spread the light of education all around, so that the darkness of ignorance nowhere remains."</p>
    <p>Empowering students with free practical tech education, study materials, and hands-on internships so financial barriers never stop talent.</p>
  </section>

  <footer id="contact">
    <p>&copy; 2026 DEVANIX TECHNOLOGIES. All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
